# The cleaned assessment exports (CSV/JSON) retain the counsellor CRM id
# (PII_Removal_Checklist.txt lists it as preserved, not redacted), so they are
# no longer tracked. They stay on disk for the local pipeline (leads/features.py
# etc.) to read; only git stops shipping them. They were tracked from cfdac78
# onward and already pushed before this change, so removing them here does not
# remove them from git history -- see the commit that added this ignore rule.
*.csv
*.json
!.gitignore
